      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present 58 Abbeywood Way, Lucan, to the market.\r\n\r\nThis charming bungalow offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation, comprising an entrance hallway, a spacious living room/bedroom, a kitchen/dining area, a main bathroom and a double bedroom at ground floor level. The converted attic space is currently used as a bedroom complete with en-suite facilities, offering excellent versatility for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private back garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nAbbeywood is a mature and well-established residential development, ideally located close to a wide range of amenities and transport links. Residents can enjoy easy access to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, while the M50, M4 and N4 are all within convenient reach. The surrounding area also offers an excellent selection of shops, schools, cafés, public transport options and sporting facilities."
      },
